  {
   "id": "mcpherson",
   "title": "Reynolds and the Iron Brigade",
   "time": "Wed 1 July, 10:20 am - 12:30",
   "narrative": "By 10:20 Heth's men had driven the troopers back to McPherson Ridge, just as the head of Reynolds's I Corps arrived. North of the pike Davis's brigade broke into Cutler's line but was thrown back near the unfinished railroad cut. South of it the Iron Brigade captured Archer and hundreds of his men in Herbst Woods. Reynolds was shot dead near the woods, and Doubleday took over. The fight in this sector then paused until about 2:30.",
